@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check (Happy Path)
# Expected: 200 OK with success message and timestamp
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. 404 Route Not Found
# Expected: 404 Not Found with custom JSON error message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/this-route-does-not-exist
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. POST to a GET-only route
# Expected: 404 Not Found (since POST /api/health isn't defined)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "test": "data"
}